## Rollback Plan

| Task | Rollback Strategy |
|:---|:---|
| **A.1** | `docker compose -f docker-compose.stayassist.yml down` → revert REDIS_URL to 6379 |
| **A.2** | Delete `auth-guard.ts` → restore raw `getSession()` boilerplate in actions → rollback migration 029 |
| **A.3** | `git checkout -- package.json src/lib/telemetry.ts src/lib/otel-node-sdk.ts src/instrumentation.ts` → `pnpm install` |
| **A.4** | `git checkout -- src/lib/offline-sync.ts src/store/ IntakeForm.tsx next.config.mjs package.json` → `pnpm install` |
| **A.5** | Restore the `onAuthStateChange` cookie synthesis block in `login/page.tsx` |
| **A.6** | Revert env vars to hardcoded values in `login/page.tsx` |
| **A.7** | Delete `(admin)/layout.tsx`, `(dpo)/layout.tsx`, `(staff)/layout.tsx` |
| **A.8** | Remove auth guards from `hospitals/route.ts` and `faqs/route.ts` |
| **A.9** | Revert `org-dashboard/page.tsx` to service-role `createClient()` |
| **B.1** | Re-add FK: `ALTER TABLE complaints ADD CONSTRAINT complaints_patient_id_fkey FOREIGN KEY (patient_id) REFERENCES users(id)` |
| **B.2** | `ALTER TABLE complaint_phi DROP COLUMN key_version` |
| **B.3** | Revert `columns.tsx` to CRDT-based resolve (stale but functional for demo) |
